-# `react-tabs`
-
-## Installation
-
-```sh
-$ yarn add @radix-ui/react-tabs
-# or
-$ npm install @radix-ui/react-tabs
-```
-
-## Usage
-
-View docs [here](https://radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/components/tabs).
