-# `react-compose-refs`
-
-## Installation
-
-```sh
-$ yarn add @radix-ui/react-compose-refs
-# or
-$ npm install @radix-ui/react-compose-refs
-```
-
-## Usage
-
-This is an internal utility, not intended for public usage.
