-# `react-slot`
-
-## Installation
-
-```sh
-$ yarn add @radix-ui/react-slot
-# or
-$ npm install @radix-ui/react-slot
-```
-
-## Usage
-
-View docs [here](https://radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/utilities/slot).
