-# `react-focus-guards`
-
-## Installation
-
-```sh
-$ yarn add @radix-ui/react-focus-guards
-# or
-$ npm install @radix-ui/react-focus-guards
-```
-
-## Usage
-
-This is an internal utility, not intended for public usage.
