-// Fragment shader functions to calculate signed distance
-// https://iquilezles.org/articles/distfunctions2d/
-// ellipse: https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4lsXDN 
-
-/**
- * param p - point
- * float r - circle radius, eg 0.5 for unit circle
