-            /**
-             * 
-             * The diameter of the hole in the centre of the pie, measured
-             * as a percent of node size (e.g. 100%) or an absolute length
-             * (e.g. 25px). This effectively converts the pie chart into a
-             * ring chart (default disabled, 0).
-             */
