-
-Symmetric cubic easing; scales [cubicIn](#easeCubicIn) for *t* in [0, 0.5] and [cubicOut](#easeCubicOut) for *t* in [0.5, 1]. Also equivalent to [poly](#easePoly).[exponent](#poly_exponent)(3).
-
