-
-<a name="easeBounceInOut" href="#easeBounceInOut">#</a> d3.<b>easeBounceInOut</b>(<i>t</i>) [<>](https://github.com/d3/d3-ease/blob/master/src/bounce.js#L20 "Source")
-
